176|/***
177| * MARK: formatTaskTitleFirstLine
178| * @description Single source of truth for the one-line task title shown on
179| * cards, inspector headers, queue rows, and the Now Playing bar. Task goals
180| * are markdown: only the first line is shown and leading `#` heading markers
181| * are stripped (every level, so `## Section` reads `Section` exactly like the
