349|/***
350| * MARK: RUN_ATTRIBUTION_KEYS
351| * @description The timeline run-attribution vocabulary, identical to the
352| *   backend `reportMetadata` field names (one concept = one name). Listed
353| *   once so the display fail-safe below and any future consumer strip the
354| *   same fields.
355| ***/
356|const RUN_ATTRIBUTION_KEYS = ['harnessId', 'modelRef', 'aliasName', 'targetIndex'];
